$ Milestone 7, §5.5/§7/§12: `system.*`. os()/arch()/hostname() reflect
$ the actual machine fly-cc is running on, so this checks structural
$ properties (non-empty tex, no embedded whitespace) rather than exact
$ values -- an exact-value test would be non-portable across machines.

bring system

os = system.os()
arch = system.arch()
host = system.hostname()

show(count(os) > 0)
show(count(arch) > 0)
show(count(host) > 0)

show(has(os, " "))
